@startuml SEQ04_rafraichissement_dashboard
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A6CF7
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #E65100
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam noteBorderColor #F57F17
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam Padding 8

title SEQ04 — Rafraîchissement Dashboards & Consultation KPIs\nAngular → Spring Boot → PostgreSQL

actor "Utilisateur\n(Analyste/Directeur)" as USER
participant "Navigateur\n(Angular App)" as ANG
participant "KpiService\n(Angular)" as SVC
participant "Spring Boot API\n(:8080)" as SPRING
participant "KpiController\n(@RestController)" as CTRL
participant "KpiService\n(Java)" as JAVASVC
database "PostgreSQL\nschéma reporting" as PG

USER -> ANG : Ouvre dashboard Collectes\n(http://serveur:80/collectes)

ANG -> ANG : <b>AuthGuard</b> vérifie JWT\nen localStorage/sessionStorage

ANG -> SPRING : <b>GET</b> /api/kpi/collectes\n?dateDebut=2026-01-01&dateFin=2026-03-31\n&zoneId=2\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
activate SPRING

SPRING -> SPRING : <b>JwtAuthFilter</b>\nValide signature + expiration JWT

SPRING -> SPRING : <b>@PreAuthorize</b>\nVérifie rôle ANALYSTE ou DIRECTEUR ou RR

SPRING -> CTRL : Route vers KpiController.getCollectes()
activate CTRL

CTRL -> JAVASVC : kpiService.getCollecteStats(params)
activate JAVASVC

JAVASVC -> PG : <b>SELECT</b> FROM reporting.v_kpi_collectes\nWHERE date_complete BETWEEN ? AND ?\nAND zone_id = ?\nORDER BY date_complete
note right PG : Vue matérialisée\npré-agrégée\n→ réponse < 200ms

PG --> JAVASVC : ResultSet (agrégés par jour/zone/canal)

JAVASVC -> JAVASVC : <b>mapToDto()</b>\nResultSet → KpiCollectesResponse

deactivate JAVASVC
CTRL --> SPRING : KpiCollectesResponse
deactivate CTRL

SPRING --> ANG : <b>200 OK</b>\n{\n  "totalCollectes": 1245,\n  "montantTotal": 87300000,\n  "tauxMobileMoney": 0.68,\n  "series": [...]\n}
deactivate SPRING

ANG -> SVC : Reçoit données JSON
SVC -> ANG : <b>Mise à jour composants</b>\n(Chart.js : graphiques\nAngular Material : tableaux)

ANG --> USER : Dashboard affiché\n(graphiques + KPIs + filtres)

note over USER, PG : Chaque filtre (zone, période, agent)\ndéclenche un nouvel appel GET /api/kpi/*\n→ Angular HttpClient + RxJS debounce 300ms

@enduml
